{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在S09把“难受时想有人陪”进一步解释成“怕孤单到愿意再受那些气”，比X更早、更明确地替人物下了判断，损失了一点心理暧昧和细腻度。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮短语让观众迅速抓住每段的核心判断，再用随音乐进程出现的感受文字分配注意力，不必一次面对所有描述。人物从离开后的空落、怀念与抗拒的反复拉扯，到最后承认矛盾、带着想念继续生活，Y的前后联系更容易被普通观众捕捉；同时，具体的节奏、音型、声音变化和身体反应让感受比单纯的情绪标签更细致。X的并列结构也有直观优势，但大量短词同时出现时，容易让观众记住零散感受，却不容易看出它们如何随着音乐和人物心理一步步变化。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "20cfe1d0-5fab-44f6-b711-0d62b026782b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002642956736Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:27:42.882280+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0dd3f8f6635636bb9b9f3c60258424fe137c7e7e5ba7a1a15a77a9ded674217d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"